# Brigid's Command, modes 1 and 2: "Create a token that's a copy of target Kithkin you control" and "Target player creates a 1/1 green and
# white Kithkin creature token". Bot1 controls a Figure of Fable (a Kithkin Scout) and an Ornithopter; Bot2 controls its own Figure of Fable.
# Refused for the copy: Bot2's Kithkin (not "you control") and Bot1's Ornithopter (not a Kithkin). Bot1 copies its own Figure and has Bot2
# create the 1/1 Kithkin token: Bot1 ends with two Figures of Fable, the second a token, and Bot2 with its Figure and a green and white token.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Figure of Fable
Brigid's Command
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Figure of Fable
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Figure of Fable.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Figure of Fable.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brigid's Command.Cast
! Bot1.Modes(1)
! Bot1.Modes(1; 2; 3)
Bot1.Modes(1; 2)
! Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Figure of Fable)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Figure of Fable)
Bot1.Target(Bot2)
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Figure of Fable#1.Token = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Figure of Fable#2.Token = true
Bot2.Battlefield.Kithkin Token.Power = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Kithkin Token.Toughness = 1
Bot2.Battlefield.Kithkin Token.Colors.Count = 2
Bot2.Battlefield.Figure of Fable.Token = (absent)
